    {
      "text": "AI Security scans your Amazon Web Services (AWS) cloud accounts to detect vulnerabilities."
    },
    {
      "text": "Vulnerability scanning is supported for both AWS-managed and customer-managed encryption. However, to support AWS-managed encryption, at least one customer-managed key should be present in the region."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Supported Regions",
      "level": 2
    },
